    "title": "Sweet Krispy Kreme Deal Celebrates 'Malcolm In The Middle' Reboot's Debut",
    "text": "Krispy Kreme is rolling out a limited-time promotion to celebrate the return of \"Malcolm in the Middle.\" Glazed doughnuts from Krispy Kreme. Photo Credit: Krispy Kreme 04/08/2026 9:00 a.m. The doughnut chain announced its \"Malcolm in the Middle Mix Pack\" in a news release on Tuesday, April 7. The deal will be available from Friday, April 10, through Sunday, April 12, at participating locations across the US.The specialty mix pack features 10 Original Glazed doughnuts arranged around 20 doughnut dots placed \"in the middle,\" including 10 Original Glazed Doughnut Dots and 10 Sprinkle Doughnut Dots. The pack comes in a themed dozen box inspired by the show.The promotion coincides with the April 10 premiere of \"Malcolm in the Middle: Life's Still Unfair\" on Hulu. The limited, four-episode reboot brings back several original cast members like Frankie Muniz as Malcolm, Bryan Cranston as Hal, and Jane Kaczmarek as Lois. The revival will follow the family two decades after the Fox sitcom ended. According to IMDb, Malcolm and his daughter will be \"drawn into the family's chaos\" when he returns home for his parents' 40th anniversary party.The mix pack will be available in-store and for pickup or delivery through Krispy Kreme's app and website. Click here to follow Daily Voice Hartford and receive free news updates.",
